    { "type": "text", "id": "final_caption", "x": 60, "y": 400, "width": 950, "height": 44,
      "text": "The shared counter store, the atomic check-and-consume script, and the fail-open path all exist for one reason:\nto make this simple mental model hold up under concurrent traffic and a store outage, not just on a whiteboard.",
